WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.535
The meeting of two friends,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.537
both set up to be leaders for life,

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.106
showing off their vision

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.174
of a post-American world order.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.577
The pomp encircled stands

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.779
a credibility boost for Russian leader

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:13.980
Vladimir Putin,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.581
displaying

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.416
that he's got a powerful friend

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.385
in Chinese leader Xi Jinping.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.787
Even as the international Criminal Court

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.722
has a warrant for his arrest

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:23.289
for committing

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.191
war crimes and allegedly shipping

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.260
Ukrainian children to Russia.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.496
And even as the West isolates him

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.032
amid his stalled invasion of Ukraine,

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.867
both she and Putin

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.968
writing glowing op

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.137
eds about their countries relations.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:38.872
She calling their relationship

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.507
an eternal friendship.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.174
Putin

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.542
saying the two are standing

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.811
shoulder to shoulder against America's

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.279
increasingly aggressive

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.648
efforts to deter Russia and China.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.683
Xi Jinping is trying

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.318
to walk a delicate line

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.421
so far, stopping short of providing

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.889
lethal aid to Russia,

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.756
though the US says

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.258
he may be considering it.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.592
While also refusing

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.294
to condemn the invasion.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.395
Meanwhile, Beijing

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.863
is also taking advantage

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.598
of Russia's isolation.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.200
Trade between the two nations

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.537
jumped to $190 billion last year,

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.940
an increase of 30% from 2021,

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.209
undercutting the impact of US

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.377
led sanctions.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.578
As Chinese companies

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.580
snap up cheap energy from Russia,

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.348
giving the Kremlin key funds

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.983
to finance the invasion.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.318
But Beijing wants the world

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.287
to focus less on their friendship

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:28.788
and more on Xi's role

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.290
as a global statesman

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.324
who can broker peace

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.193
deals like the historic deal

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:33.626
he helped

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.161
forge to restore relations

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.263
between Saudi Arabia and Iran.

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.131
I've been talking

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.165
to people in this Hutong,

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:39.933
this old Beijing

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.767
residential alley,

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:41.434
to get a sense

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:41.768
of what

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.336
Chinese people think about Xi

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.270
Jinping's visit.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.573
This man tells me Xi's visit is good

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.374
because it can further improve China.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.610
Russia relations do a couple of hundred.

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.178
He says he likes Putin a lot

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.247
because he's a cool, tough guy.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.882
On the Ukraine war, he says.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:56.583
He just hopes

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:57.951
everyone can have a peaceful

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.286
relationship. Hazard Video.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.688
This woman tells me she hopes

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.190
Russia wins the war, but peace is best.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.126
Another woman

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:06.826
says the war

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:07.727
and loss of life

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:09.996
is heartbreaking and painful to watch.

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:11.564
She says it's wrong for America

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.266
to send weapons to Ukraine,

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.334
and she believes in Xi

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:16.636
Jinping's vision of world peace.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.438
When I ask her what she thinks of Putin,

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:19.072
she answers

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.006
that he's righteous,

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.075
decisive, swift and tough.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:23.643
But when I follow up and ask

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.145
if she's heard of the ICC

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.347
issuing an arrest warrant for Putin,

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.548
she responds,

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:29.649
I didn't know

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.184
he started the war after all.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:32.952
He should sit down with Zelensky

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.287
and talk.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.855
This shoe repairman says.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.023
Why are they fighting?

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.725
It doesn't do anybody good,

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:40.293
but we don't know who started the war,

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:41.194
he adds.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.829
It's the Ukrainians, right?

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.197
Who are you hear about?

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.632
She doesn't need to convince

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:46.900
the audience in China,

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.201
where media is heavily

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:49.669
censored of the merits

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.571
of his tight bond with Putin.

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:53.173
But the rest of the world is watching

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:53.606
to see

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.108
what comes of Beijing's

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:57.143
claims of neutrality.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:03:01.347
Yeah, and Jake, Russia's state news

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:02.015
agency said

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.683
talks between Xi and Putin lasted

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.418
for four and a half hours.

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:06.186
Chinese state media

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.287
has been framing this visit

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:08.588
as a trip for peace

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:09.589
and it's striking there

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:11.024
how almost everyone I spoke

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:11.591
to on the streets

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.593
of Beijing echoed that perspective

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.728
with very positive views of Putin.

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.763
But you have to remember, that's

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:17.897
because in China, social

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.165
media, media in general

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.166
is heavily censored.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.101
So it's pretty much the only viewpoint

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:23.403
most people can see.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:23.803
But look,

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:24.204
the China

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.104
Russia relationship

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.973
has historically been a tricky one,

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:27.974
but their shared

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:29.909
growing adversarial relationship

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.177
with the US led rest

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:33.513
is really driving Putin and Xi together.

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.281
Jake Wang in Beijing for us,

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:35.915
thank you so much.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:37.250
US officials say the President

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.552
Xi has yet to call Ukraine's

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:40.520
president Volodymyr

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.388
Zelensky, despite China's

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.857
assertion that it wants to play a role

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:46.960
as a peacemaker in the conflict

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.128
between Ukraine and invading Russia.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.263
CNN's Ivan

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:52.365
Watson is in Kharkiv, Ukraine for us.

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:52.632
And Ivan,

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:55.001
how has Ukraine responded to this meeting

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:58.037
between Xi and Putin?

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:00.273
Well, it's watching very closely.

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:02.609
And I would add probably nervously,

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:04.611
as you pointed out,

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:05.311
Ukraine,

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.879
I think there's a lot of skepticism

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:08.581
about whether or not Xi Jinping

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:09.816
and the Chinese government

00:04:09.816 --> 00:04:11.017
are truly neutral

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:12.252
as they profess to be

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:14.153
when it comes to this war.

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:15.488
But they'd rather have

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:17.490
China pretend to be neutral

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:21.327
than actually full throated offer weapons

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:24.364
and ammunition to Ukraine's much larger

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:25.632
enemy, Russia.

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:26.633
So you've got statements

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:27.133
coming out

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.368
like the president

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:28.935
and Lansky's

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.204
office saying that supporting

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:32.639
only the Russian side

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:33.473
will not lead

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.875
to the finalization of the war.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.977
The Foreign Ministry spokesperson saying

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:38.611
we expect

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.514
Beijing to use its influence on Moscow to

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:42.181
to put

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:42.649
an end

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:43.750
to Russia's aggressive

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.019
war against Ukraine

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:48.688
and another top security official saying

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.823
that if China wants to fulfill

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:51.891
its so-called peace

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.393
plan for Ukraine, the first

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:54.527
and foremost point

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:55.495
is the surrender

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.829
or withdrawal of Russian

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:59.599
occupation forces from the territory

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:01.167
of Ukraine.

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:01.701
Also,

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:04.704
a top Ukrainian intelligence official

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:06.272
says that the Ukrainians

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.174
are watching very closely

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:10.310
the ammunition that they're capturing

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.244
and noticing

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.413
on the Russian side, on the front lines.

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:15.948
And so far they have seen no evidence

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:19.118
of deliveries of Chinese arms

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:20.520
to the Russian side.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.054
But again,

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:23.323
they're watching this very closely.

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:24.257
And Ivan,

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:24.924
this meeting

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:25.425
between Xi

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:26.893
and Putin comes on the same day

00:05:26.893 --> 00:05:27.960
that the European Union

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.896
has agreed to provide more support

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.464
for Ukraine on the front lines.

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:34.167
Tell us about that.

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:37.236
That is sending an important message

00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:38.371
not only to the Ukrainians,

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:39.372
but arguably

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:40.440
to the Russians

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.708
and the Chinese leaders

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.443
as they meet in Moscow.

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.610
The European Union,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.878
17 European

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.413
countries, plus Norway, announcing

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:49.048
that they're going to ship

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:49.816
a million

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:52.719
rounds of 155 millimeter artillery

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:55.455
ammunition to the Ukrainians,

00:05:55.455 --> 00:05:56.155
that they're going to try

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.557
to put $1,000,000,000

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:58.324
into that effort

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:00.526
and then another billion euros, rather,

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:03.262
into procuring more ammunition.

00:06:03.596 --> 00:06:05.164
The Ukrainians delighted with that.

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:05.865
And that comes on

00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:06.966
top of

00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:08.368
the Biden administration

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:12.271
announcing an additional $350 million

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.307
in presidential drawdown funds.

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:15.308
That's for ammunition

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:16.909
for those High Marrs

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:17.677
that the Ukrainians

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:20.012
love, the long distance missile

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:22.382
launching systems as well as howitzers.

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:24.484
Bradley Infantry fighting vehicles, hard

00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:26.219
missiles, anti-tank weapons.

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:28.888
And that's on top of earlier this month,

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.724
hundreds of millions of dollars in U.S.

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:34.660
presidential drawdown defense assistance.

00:06:34.861 --> 00:06:37.196
And that comes all on top of some $32

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:39.065
billion in defense aid

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:39.665
that has come

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:41.801
from the Biden administration.

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:43.136
And just another country

00:06:43.136 --> 00:06:44.737
that's offered aid.

00:06:44.737 --> 00:06:45.805
Small Norway

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.306
says it has now sent

00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:49.976
eight leopard, two tanks to Ukraine.

00:06:50.009 --> 00:06:50.543
All of this

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.178
is just trying to demonstrate

00:06:52.178 --> 00:06:54.414
that European countries, the West,

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:55.148
the U.S.

00:06:55.148 --> 00:06:56.516
are supporting Ukraine

00:06:56.516 --> 00:06:59.218
in its battle against its much larger

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:03.656
enemy with a much larger population.

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:05.825
It's held the line so far,

00:07:05.825 --> 00:07:08.027
but it still needs help.

00:07:08.027 --> 00:07:08.494
All right, Ivan

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:09.962
Watson in Kiev, Ukraine, thank

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:10.530
you so much.

